        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Edward Scobie\n- Publications: Black Britannia: A History of Blacks in Britain\n- Topics: Black history of Western Europe, African immigration to Europe, Africans in Europe\n\nFacts:\n- Edward Scobie is best known for his research into the black history of Western Europe.\n- In 1972, Edward Scobie published the seminal book \"Black Britannia: A History of Blacks in Britain\".\n- African immigrants in Europe are people who were born in Africa and live in Europe or people of African descent who live in Europe.",
